Ported components:

- src/ts/modules/achievements/MiniAchievements.ts
  From src/steam/miniAchievements.ts (v0.6.4). It derives from the
  achievement-bar work in Decky UI Restored by beallio
  (https://github.com/beallio/Decky-UI-Restored), GPL-3.0-or-later. Supplies
  the missing onSeek callback so Steam's own mini achievements row renders on
  the Gaming Mode game page (ValveSoftware/steam-for-linux#13540).

- src/ts/gamepadTextArea.ts
  From src/steam/gamepadTextArea.ts (v0.6.4). Resolves Steam's gamepad-aware
  textarea so multiline fields receive on-screen keyboard input.

- src/ts/contextMenuPatch.tsx
  The context menu patching technique, from src/contextMenuPatch.tsx (v0.6.4),
  itself derived from decky-steamgriddb by the SteamGridDB project
  (https://github.com/SteamGridDB/decky-steamgriddb), GPL-3.0.

- src/ts/modules/metadata/IgnSearch.ts
  The IGN search: same GraphQL queries and field mapping as
  backend-rust/src/providers/ign.rs (v0.6.4), rewritten in TypeScript.

- src/ts/modules/metadata/SteamMatch.ts
  The "Find a Steam Match" store search and preview: same store endpoints as
  backend-rust/src/providers/steam.rs (v0.6.4), rewritten in TypeScript.

- src/ts/modules/compatdata/providers/SteamMatchCompatdataProvider.tsx
  Valve's compatibility of the matched Steam app: same store report
  (ajaxgetdeckappcompatibilityreport) as backend-rust/src/providers/steam.rs
  (v0.6.4), rewritten in TypeScript.

- src/ts/modules/metadata/MetadataEditorStyles.ts
  The editor page styles, adapted from src/metadataEditorStyles.ts,
  src/styles.tsx and src/tokens.ts (v0.6.4), so both editors look alike.

The "Change Metadata" page (src/ts/modules/metadata/MetadataEditor.tsx) is a
new implementation for MetaDeck, modelled on Decky Metadata's metadata editor
(single page with a sticky action bar, search, "Source" fields and "Steam
info fields").
